{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32017","headline":"送陕府王建司马 · 贾岛","name":"送陕府王建司马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"司马虽然听晓钟，尚犹高枕恣疎慵。\n请诗僧过三门水，卖药人归五老峰。\n移舫绿阴深处息，登楼凉夜此时逢。\n杜陵惆怅临相饯，未寝月前多屐踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}